Screen Open 0,320,200,8,Lowres : Curs Off : Cls 0
Open Out 2,"AMOSTEST:aaa.txt" : Close 2
Open Out 2,"AMOSTEST:bbb.txt" : Close 2
Open Out 9,"AMOSTEST:out/ready" : Close 9
F$=Fsel$("AMOSTEST:*.txt","","Choose a file","Second line")
Print #1,F$
Open Out 9,"AMOSTEST:out/again" : Close 9
F$=Fsel$("AMOSTEST:","default.txt","Title")
Print #1,F$
Print #1,"end"
